// A skin only changes what the player sees: dish names, words in tutorials,
// food art, station accent colors and the restaurant background.
//   slot           Ch1 Dumpling Den     Ch2 Bao Bun Bakery   Ch3 Dim Sum Tea House  Ch4 Golden Dragon Banquet
//   tray→oven      jiaozi (steamer)     gua bao              siu mai                 xiao long bao
//   cream          soy sauce            braised pork         sweet soy               ginger vinegar
//   straw / rasp   scallion / chive     cucumber / pickle    crab roe / carrot       goji / red chili   (look-alike pair)
//   blue (premium) shrimp               golden egg yolk      scallop                 crab
//   milk           jasmine tea          soy milk             chrysanthemum tea       lychee bubble tea
//   waffle         spring roll          sesame ball          turnip cake             pan-fried bun
//   pudding        mango pudding        almond jelly         egg tart                mooncake
